    "findings": [
      "All three original paintings, full native-size composition and four-row plate sheet inspected. Dark volcanic-sand runway and teal ocean read as a distinct habitat; native size is 1672 by 941 with no upscaling.",
      "MID repeats distant islands and cloud shapes over FAR, producing pasted mountain silhouettes near the horizon. Visible pink/green fringe survives at outer fern tips and mountain edges despite zero unresolved-edge pixels in the intake metric.",
      "NEAR adds another wet rocky shelf with a prominent horizontal change in texture around the lower fifth; large edge rocks rise above the requested 0.92 band, although sampled combatant stands remain clear. The result needs authoring-side layer/seam and fringe repair, not acceptance."
    ],
